# =============================================================================
# ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION
# =============================================================================
#
# The frontend application environment variables are documented in:
#   Dechat/dex_with_fiat_frontend/.env.example
#
# Please copy that file to create your local environment configuration:
#   cp Dechat/dex_with_fiat_frontend/.env.example Dechat/dex_with_fiat_frontend/.env.local
#
# Then fill in the required values for your environment.
#
# =============================================================================
#
# SECURITY: NEVER commit real secret values to this file or any tracked file.
# Use placeholders only (e.g. <your-api-key>, changeme, example-value).
# Real values belong in your local .env / .env.local (git-ignored) or in your
# secret manager. See SECURITY.md for the secret inventory, rotation cadence,
# and leak-response procedure (issue #116).
# =============================================================================

# --- Example placeholders (do not put real values here) ---------------------
# API_KEY=<your-api-key>
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://<user>:<password>@<host>:<port>/<db>
# JWT_SECRET=<random-32-byte-secret>
# RPC_URL=https://<network>.example.com/<your-api-key>
